    "text": "Let <math><mi>Z</mi></math> be the set of integers. If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>Z</mi><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>{</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>Z</mi><mtext>&#8201;&#8201;</mtext><mo>:</mo><mo>-</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mn>3</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>}</mo></math>, then the number of subsets of the set <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>B</mi></math>, is :",
