  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>0</mn></msup><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>3</mn></math>.</p><p><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>n</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p>Again, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>4</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>n</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>B</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn></math></p><p><math><mo>&#8756;</mo></math>Number of subset of <math><mi>A</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>15</mn></mrow></msup></math></p>",
